/target
# Upstream reference clones, used read-only as the protocol source of truth.
# Re-create with:
#   git clone https://github.com/intechstudio/grid-fw       vendor/grid-fw
#   git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/intechstudio/grid-protocol vendor/grid-protocol
# grid-fw needs its FULL tag history, not --depth 1: behaviour differs between
# firmware releases (immediate-script framing, the 1.5.2 feature additions, the
# stored action-string convention), and those are found by diffing tags. Older
# tags also keep the sources under grid_common/ rather than common/src/c/.
# An existing shallow clone: git -C vendor/grid-fw fetch --tags --unshallow
/vendor
# Device configuration dumps and firmware images: local working data,
# not part of the library.
/backups
